      {
        "rank": 1,
        "evidence_text": "Rain Tyres\tTyre Marking: Max 2 sets before qualifying For each session it is only allowed the use of a single set of wet tyres, for avoidance of doubt Q1 and Q2 will be consider as a single session. The use of unmarked or previously marked rain tyres during free practice and test sessions is permitted.\tTyre Marking: Max 2 sets before qualifying For each session it is only allowed the use of a single set of wet tyres, for avoidance of doubt Q1 and Q2 will be consider as a single session. The use of unmarked or previously marked rain tyres during free practice and test sessions is permitted.\nJoker Tyres\t10 pcs of joker tyres slick are available over the season with the following limitation: 2 front + 2 rear max available at each meeting. From qualifying onwards, the following rules will be applied when using the joker tyres as replacement of marked tyres 1 joker tyres = no penalty 2 joker tyres = 2 grid drop 3 joker tyres = 4 grid drop 4 joker tyres = 6 grid drops. If the competitor decides to use the joker tyres during free practice no penalty will be applied (regardless of number of joker tyres). Joker tyres must be marked.",
